# The server image builds from the REPOSITORY ROOT, because two server modules
# read files from `packages/contracts` at compile time (see
# infra/images/server/Dockerfile). Without this file the context would include
# every node_modules tree, every build output and the whole .git directory --
# tens of thousands of files that no image layer uses.
#
# This is an EXCLUDE list rather than an allow-list on purpose: an allow-list
# silently drops a newly added compile-time input and fails the build in the
# same confusing way the `apps/server` context did.

.git
.github
.planning
.gsd

**/node_modules
**/_build
**/deps
**/.elixir_ls
**/dist
**/out
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

apps/desktop
apps/ios
apps/web
infra/tofu/**/.terraform

**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
